WeTheFans Privacy Policy
Effective Date: November 2025

WeTheFans (“the App,” “we,” “our,” or “us”) values your privacy. This policy describes what information we collect and how we use it.

1. Information We Collect
   • Device Identifier: We collect a randomly generated device identifier to ensure that each device can submit only one Top 25 ballot per week.  
   • No Personal Data: We do not collect names, email addresses, phone numbers, or any personally identifying information.  
   • No Location or Tracking: We do not track your location, browsing activity, or usage across other apps.

2. How We Use Information
   • To verify one-vote-per-device fairness.  
   • To generate weekly aggregate rankings.  
   • For basic analytics on total votes and participation.

3. Data Retention
   • Device identifiers and ballot data are retained only as long as necessary to calculate and display weekly results.  
   • Aggregated statistics (without identifiers) may be stored for historical records.

4. Data Sharing
   • We do not sell, rent, or share your data with third parties.  
   • All vote data are processed anonymously within the App’s servers.

5. Security
   • Reasonable technical measures are in place to protect all stored information against unauthorized access.

6. Children’s Privacy
   • The App is rated 4+ and intended for a general audience. We do not knowingly collect data from children under 13.

7. Changes
   • This policy may be updated periodically. The “Effective Date” above will reflect the latest version.

8. Contact
   • For privacy questions, please contact:  
     **support@wethefans.app**

By using *WeTheFans*, you agree to this Privacy Policy.
